<title>USA: JC Penney may issue $400 mln in 100-yr debt.</title>
<headline>JC Penney may issue $400 mln in 100-yr debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Penney &amp; Co Inc is expected to tap the corporate bond primary market with a $400 million debt deal, syndicate sources said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to consist of a 100-year maturity with CS First Boston as lead underwriter for the issue, sources said.</p>
<p>The debt offering is expected to be launched on Thursday, they added.</p>
<p>((-- Nancy Leinfuss, 212-859-1675))</p>
